@block {"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0,"concealed":false,"annotationId":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"行内公式可以像文字一样参与叙述：若 "},{"type":"mathInline","attrs":{"latex":"a^2+b^2=c^2","delimiter":"$"}},{"type":"text","text":"，三条边组成一个直角三角形。点击公式可以修改它的 LaTeX 源码。"}]}
@block {"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"独立公式可以靠左、居中或靠右。下面的损失函数靠左排列，兼顾拟合误差与参数约束："}]}
@block {"type":"mathBlock","attrs":{"textAlign":"left","textColor":null,"background":null,"concealed":false,"annotationId":null,"latex":"\\mathcal{L}(\\theta)=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\left(y_i-f_{\\theta}(x_i)\\right)^2+\\lambda\\lVert\\theta\\rVert_2^2","delimiter":"\\["}}
@block {"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这个靠右的分段函数把数值从 0 平滑过渡到 1，常用于动画与插值；两端斜率为零，曲线下的面积恰好为一半："}]}
@block {"type":"mathBlock","attrs":{"textAlign":"right","textColor":null,"background":null,"concealed":false,"annotationId":null,"latex":"\\begin{aligned}\ns(t)&=\\begin{cases}\n0, & t\\le 0,\\\\[2pt]\n3t^2-2t^3, & 0<t<1,\\\\[2pt]\n1, & t\\ge 1,\n\\end{cases}\\\\[6pt]\ns'(0)&=s'(1)=0,\\qquad \\int_0^1 s(t)\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\frac12.\n\\end{aligned}","delimiter":"\\["}}
@block {"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0,"concealed":false,"annotationId":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"支持 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"$…$"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"$$…$$"},{"type":"text","text":"、"},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"\\(…\\)"},{"type":"text","text":" 和 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"\\[…\\]"},{"type":"text","text":"。公式有语法错误时，源码会保留下来，方便继续修正。"}]}
